# St. Jude Children's Research Hospital
> St. Jude advances cures and prevention for childhood cancer and other life-threatening diseases through research, treatment, and global collaboration.
> ALSAC is the fundraising and awareness organization for St. Jude. Most funding comes from donors, which means no family ever receives a bill from St. Jude.

